OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fwill die out this evening. Then much
OL,7,Fof the night will be dry with clear
OL,8,Fperiods but rain arriving in southern
OL,9,Fcounties around dawn. Freshening
OL,10,Fsoutherly winds along the east coast
OL,11,Flater.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FWidespread rain, occasionally
OL,14,Fheavy, will spread northeast during
OL,15,Fthe morning. Drier and brighter
OL,16,Fweather will spread from the west in
OL,17,Fthe afternoon with just the odd shower
OL,18,Faround.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
